        Where you park your car overnight moves the needle on your insurance bill more than the badge on the hood or the engine underneath it. Move from Portland, Maine to Miami, and your annual premium can triple without a single ticket on your record. Use the searchable table below to see where your state lands in 2026.
      </p>

